From 14de269d013f72d797c3baf249fdec65bdbcee89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: euxane <euxane.trangirard@euxane.eu>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 02:24:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] resolver: async resolution of Address and Proxy (backport to
 1.1pre18)

Backport of the 1.1_async_resolver branch to release-1.1pre18.

Squashes:
  21bee88c resolver: add async host name resolution
  a165373a address_cache: resolve Address statements asynchronously
  6ab3e0cc address_cache: parallelise resolution of all Address statements
  3100c0a2 net_socket: async resolution for the Proxy address
  ee588718 doc: update for background Address and Proxy async resolution

Adapted to 1.1pre18:
* autotools instead of meson (tincd now always links with -pthread),
* HAVE_MINGW instead of HAVE_WINDOWS,
* no ATTR_DEALLOCATOR,
* pointer-based configuration and outgoing list APIs.
* unit and integration tests left out (no test infra on 1.1pre18)
